Using layoff professionally conveys that the action is driven by macro factors, not the individual's actions.

835
00:43:12,160 --> 00:43:18,250
That separation of individual accountability from economic factors is a really vital professional distinction to maintain.

836
00:43:18,390 --> 00:43:19,290
Good point.

